  "document": "Half a Sinner (1940 film)\nHalf a Sinner is a 1940 American film directed by Al Christie. It stars Heather Angel as a schoolteacher who in one day becomes Public Enemy Number One in Pennsylvania. The film is based on Dalton Trumbo's short story\" Lady Takes a Chance\". The working titles of this film were\" Everything Happens to Ann\" and\" The Lady Takes a Chance\"."
